  summary: [["Assembler", "Translate processor-specific mnemonics into the target instruction encoding."], ["Compiler", "Translate source before running the resulting build; linking may also be necessary."], ["Interpreter", "Carry out statements progressively along the program's control flow."], ["Correctness", "A translated or partly executed program still needs testing against its intended result."]],
